<Base title="Prototype: motion" noindex>
  <h1>Motion prototype (#62)</h1>
  <p>
    Chosen: “Sheets”. Each page is a sheet. Opening a page lays a new sheet over from the right; Back pulls the top
    sheet off to the right. Going home on desktop is always Back. On a phone the Lessons view is underneath every page,
    and home opens forward like any page. The pink bar slows everything ×5 and simulates reduced motion.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/">Start at home</a></p>
</Base>
